			],
			"Message": "chore(license): Relicense project under CC0 1.0 Universal\n\n- Replaced custom Land Public License v1.0 with CC0 1.0 Universal public domain dedication\n- Removes copyleft requirements and patent clauses from previous LPL structure\n- Aligns licensing with permissive reuse strategy for core editor infrastructure\n- CC0 waiver enables unrestricted use/modification/distribution of Land codebase\n- Maintains project's open source nature while removing license compatibility concerns\n- Impacts all project components by changing default contribution terms\n- Retains copyright notices but waives all rights under copyright law\n- Simplifies third-party adoption by using widely recognized public domain dedication",
			"SHA": "963ea28b1d560580e6c1d24aa3e8488e98b3b79b"
		},
